title: SOVERYN
abstract: >-
  A sovereign multi-agent fleet running entirely on local hardware:
  persistent identities, locally-cloned voices, and shared memory across
  desktop chat, a mobile messenger PWA, and voice rooms. Facts are served
  by deterministic engines the model cannot override, each cited to source.
